      "role": "assistant",
      "reasoning": "The learner sounds anxious, so I will reassure them and break the two-mark recall question into a manageable first step without giving away the answers.",
      "content": "Take a breath—this is a short detail question, not an essay. Can you name one place Kumalo searched for Absalom, even if you are unsure?"
